# VST subagents — repo-wide

When running **`night-circuit-qa`**, **`night-circuit-sound-design`**, or **`vst-gui-designer`**:

1. Read [docs/VST_SUBAGENT_SCOPE.md](../docs/VST_SUBAGENT_SCOPE.md) and identify **product** from WO paths/title.
2. Use canonical prompts: [VST_PLUGIN_QA_AGENT.md](../docs/VST_PLUGIN_QA_AGENT.md), [VST_SOUND_DESIGN_AGENT.md](../docs/VST_SOUND_DESIGN_AGENT.md), [VST_GUI_DESIGNER_AGENT.md](../docs/VST_GUI_DESIGNER_AGENT.md).
3. Night Circuit–only depth: [NIGHT_CIRCUIT_QA_SUBAGENT.md](../docs/NIGHT_CIRCUIT_QA_SUBAGENT.md), [NIGHT_CIRCUIT_SOUND_DESIGN_SUBAGENT.md](../docs/NIGHT_CIRCUIT_SOUND_DESIGN_SUBAGENT.md).

PM prefixes: `[Plugin][JUCE][QA]`, `[Plugin][JUCE][Design]`, `[Plugin][JUCE][GUI]` — not limited to `ProphetRev2Trap/`.
